config LIBPARAM
	bool "Space Inventor libparam"
	depends on LIBCSP
	depends on PICOLIBC
	help
	  Build Space Inventor libparam (csh/2.10) from modules/lib/libparam,
	  with the same source set and dynamic parameter list profile as the
	  Linux fprime-csp-libparam build. Parameters are registered at run
	  time with param_list_add(); the static "param" linker section is not
	  supported. The dynamic list allocates with malloc(), so the C library
	  heap must be large enough (CONFIG_COMMON_LIBC_MALLOC_ARENA_SIZE).
